<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oak-mistletoe, Hozanthus
			europaeus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				715b30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mistletoe-berry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.17.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>birdlime</i> prepared from the mistletoe-berry, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				433
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρευτὴς ἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>oak-gum</i>, used for the same purpose, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.451d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philox.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.742
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>any sticky substance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.314.42
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				22.1673.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. ὀμμάτων</span> of one who causes
			the eyes to be <i>fixed</i> upon him, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.Com.
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφυγὼν τὸν ἰ. τὸν ἐν πράγματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάπερ ἰξῷ τινι προσέχεται τοῖς
					τοιούτοις ἡ ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>skinflint, miser</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				718
			</span></i>. (Prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝιξός</span>, cf. Lat.
				<i>viscum, viscus.</i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
